                        "entry_id": "038419d2-ee92-33d6-a26b-c370891ff8f7",
                        "glosses": [
                            "A person who makes monetary loans at interest, taking personal property as security – which may be sold if not redeemed."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "f0ebafbc-136b-46c2-b701-f669226f0a3f",
                                "sense_id": "6ae1741c-9275-3478-9e39-f555e739491b",
                                "text": "\"We may keep it by us,\" replied the pawnbroker, \"for months; there is no demand for such articles.\" \"But,\" exclaimed she, eagerly, \"I shall soon redeem it!\" \"So you all say,\" returned the man, with imperturbable coolness."
